				Hi everyone,

I'd like to kindly request the developers to add an option to completely disable anti-aliasing (such as TAA) in a future update. 

For many of us playing at native resolution, forced anti-aliasing causes unnecessary blurriness and softens the image too much. Having a simple toggle to turn it off (or choose different AA methods) would be greatly appreciated and would give players more control over their visual clarity and performance.

Thanks for reading and considering this feature!...			&lt;/div&gt;
